# Running on a fixed seed (the ROM test runs seed 4; others differ).
# A slow Piplup L2 meets a faster wild Pokémon on Route 202: the first try fails ("Can't escape!", the foe
# still attacks: the hidden pass turn), the second gets away (decomp Battler_CanEscape: +30 per attempt).
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 2
set var platinum:VAR_ROUTE_202_STATE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_202 178 827 up
until idle
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
until battle 900
+0 battle run
until battle 3000
+0 assert battles wild 0
+0 battle run
until battle end 3000
+0 assert battle wild * fled
+0 assert battles wild 1
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
